  "name": "Blood Curse of the Howl",
  "type": "feat",
  "folder": "bhfBloodCurses00",
  "img": "icons/magic/unholy/strike-body-life-soul-purple.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Level 18, Order of the Lycan</em></p><p>As a Magic action, you unleash a bloodcurdling howl. Each creature of your choice within 30 feet of yourself that can hear you must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Frightened condition for 1 minute or until it takes any damage. While Frightened this way, a creature can take only one of the following on each of its turns: move, take an action, or take a Bonus Action. If a creature fails the save by 5 or more, it also has the Stunned condition while Frightened this way. A creature that succeeds on the save is immune to this curse for the next 24 hours.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The range of the howl increases to 60 feet.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
